q4-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"AMG 2021 Q1","e":"amg","d":"2021-05-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jay Horgen","x":"So maybe, Tom, I'll let you speak to the impact on the numbers and maybe just talk a little bit more about the discipline and our restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/03/affiliated-managers-group-amg-q1-2021-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"AMG 2021 Q3","e":"amg","d":"2021-11-01","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Tom Wojcik","x":"So as you heard in our prepared remarks, we raised our guidance significantly for the fourth quarter and for the full year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/01/affiliated-managers-group-amg-q3-2021-earnings-cal/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[33,1,7030,0,0,0,5798,808],[34,1,9874,0,0,0,8472,1062],[35,1,10467,0,0,0,8905,1113],[36,1,8880,0,0,0,7812,546],[37,1,9461,0,0,0,2700,6218],[38,1,7869,0,0,0,6843,660],[39,1,7058,0,0,0,6145,568],[40,1,7840,0,0,0,6774,667],[41,1,8377,0,0,0,7244,749],[42,1,7313,0,0,0,6347,630],[43,1,7984,0,0,0,6885,730],[44,1,9372,0,0,0,8132,851],[45,1,9316,0,0,0,8356,659],[46,1,8619,0,0,0,7452,712],[47,1,6949,0,0,0,6175,435],[48,1,8917,0,0,0,7919,704],[49,1,9248,0,0,0,8139,786],[50,1,6211,0,0,0,5667,332],[62,1,7937,0,0,0,7869,0],[67,1,5647,0,0,0,4660,782]],"cinema":[[33,1,7030,0,0,0,5798,808],[34,1,9874,0,0,0,8472,1062],[35,1,10467,0,0,0,8905,1113],[36,1,8880,0,0,0,7812,546],[37,1,9461,0,0,0,2700,6218],[38,1,7869,0,0,0,6843,660],[39,1,7058,0,0,0,6145,568],[40,1,7840,0,0,0,6774,667],[41,1,8377,0,0,0,7244,749],[42,1,7313,0,0,0,6347,630],[43,1,7984,0,0,0,6885,730],[44,1,9372,0,0,0,8132,851],[45,1,9316,0,0,0,8356,659],[46,1,8619,0,0,0,7452,712],[47,1,6949,0,0,0,6175,435],[48,1,8917,0,0,0,7919,704],[49,1,9248,0,0,0,8139,786],[50,1,6211,0,0,0,5667,332],[62,1,7937,0,0,0,7869,0],[67,1,5647,0,0,0,4660,782]],"imax":[[33,1,7030,0,0,0,5798,808],[34,1,9874,0,0,0,8472,1062],[35,1,10467,0,0,0,8905,1113],[36,1,8880,0,0,0,7812,546],[37,1,9461,0,0,0,2700,6218],[